# Files uploaded by `gcloud run deploy --source .` (Cloud Build). Without this file gcloud falls back to .gitignore,
# which excludes /build - the image needs it. Upload only what the Dockerfile copies.
**
!Dockerfile
!server/
!server/**
!api/
!api/_lib/
!api/_lib/**
!build/
!build/**
# Never upload these even if a negation above matches
**/.env*
**/node_modules/
